C['intro_add'] = ['You will compare funding models by testing the 60 percent scenario, letting you choose a campaign structure you can honestly fulfil if the target is only partly reached.', 'You will test your idea with likely backers and build an early supporter list, so the first two days of the campaign begin with real momentum.', 'You will calculate a funding goal from real production, delivery, fee and tax costs plus a buffer, preventing a successful campaign from losing money.', 'You will design three to five reward levels with realistic delivery dates, giving backers clear choices and giving yourself promises you can keep.', 'You will write a short, honest campaign page with a plain statement of risks, which helps visitors understand what you are making and trust you to finish it.', 'You will read platform terms and local advertising and payment rules and keep clean financial records, so you avoid promises you cannot lawfully make.', 'You will plan weekly updates, fast replies and a ready delay message, keeping backers informed and confident even when the schedule changes.', 'You will compare planned and actual costs and timelines after delivery and thank backers publicly, leaving you with lessons and goodwill for your next project.']
